      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BALDWIN (1) hit the ground running to score by 4.5 lengths (19.93) at this track over 340m. Drawn to take advantage of good early pace. Can make it two on the bounce. MAHOME GIRL (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (19.03) in a Grade 5 at Dubbo. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Has ability and is one of the better chances. COBRA BEACH (8) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 2.5 lengths into third (20.21) at this track in a Grade 5 over 340m. Can feature again. ZERO DARK THIRTY (3) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
